Copying a node
Use the IBM Integration API to copy a node or subflow node to a message flow.
You can copy a built-in or subflow node by using the clone() method. In the following example, a new
MQInput node mqinNode is created and properties on the node are set. A new MQInput node mqinNode1
is then created by copying mqinNode by using the clone() method. When the node is copied, the node
properties are also copied.
